    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "如果把「PaLM」拆开来看，真正改变研究方向的部分是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "到 2022 年，缩放规律推动语言模型持续增大，但高效训练这些模型需要新的分布式系统。PaLM 把模型研究与 Pathways 结合，展示了一个稠密模型如何跨越数千个加速器。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-palm-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "这听起来像一个漂亮的方向。真正让它运转起来的核心机制是什么？",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "PaLM 是在多语种文本与代码混合语料上训练的仅解码器 Transformer。其关键工程成果是在 6,144 个 TPU v4 芯片上进行高效训练，同时通过评测追踪能力如何随规模增长到 5,400 亿参数。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-palm-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "专家通常把 PaLM 视为大模型与加速器基础设施协同设计的里程碑。它还提供了有影响力的证据，说明某些语言模型能力可能随规模出现跃升，而不是平滑增长。",
            "sourceIds": ["source-palm-paper", "source-primary-record"],
            "claimIds": [
                "claim-annual-membership",
                "claim-publication-record",
                "claim-contributor-record",
                "claim-core-method",
                "claim-historical-significance"
            ],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "回看「Whisper」，再看「PaLM」，我们能听见同一个技术问题跨越年代后的回响。",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-primary-record",
                "source-openalex-record",
